{"speciesId":797,"names":{"fr":"Bamboiselle","es":"Celesteela","en":"Celesteela","ja":"テッカグヤ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Une Ultra-Chimère qui a traversé l’Ultra-Brèche. On l’aurait aperçue parcourir le ciel à grande vitesse."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Este Ultraente surgió de un Ultraumbral. Parece haber sido avistado surcando los cielos a velocidades vertiginosas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It appeared from the Ultra Wormhole. Witnesses observed it flying across the sky at high speed."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"ウルトラホールから 現れた。 高速で 空を 飛ぶ 姿が 目撃 された ウルトラビースト。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Une espèce d’Ultra-Chimère. On l’aurait aperçue expulsant du gaz par ses deux bras et réduisant une forêt tout entière en cendres."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Varios testigos afirman haber visto como este Ultraente carbonizaba un bosque entero con el gas expelido por sus extremidades."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"One kind of Ultra Beast. Witnesses have seen it burn down a forest by expelling gas from its two arms."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ＵＢの 一種。 ２本の 腕から ガスを 噴きだし 森を 焼き払う 姿が 確認 されている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Cette dangereuse créature fait partie des Ultra-Chimères. On peut détecter des pics d’énergie émis par ses bras gigantesques."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Uno de los temibles Ultraentes. Las lecturas de las reacciones energéticas procedentes de sus enormes brazos alcanzan picos desorbitados."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"One of the dangerous UBs, high energy readings can be detected coming from both of its huge arms."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"危険な ＵＢの 一種。 巨大な 両腕から 高い エネルギー反応を 検出。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Cette créature venue d’ailleurs est dangereuse dans notre monde, mais il semblerait qu’elle soit très commune dans le sien."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Para los seres de este mundo resulta extraño y peligroso, pero en el mundo del que procede es una criatura muy común."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Although it’s alien to this world and a danger here, it’s apparently a common organism in the world where it normally lives."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"この世界では 異質で 危険だが 本来 棲んでいる 世界では 普通に 見かける 生物らしい。"}],"varieties":[{"id":797,"moves":[{"name":"fly","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[17,"level-up",73],[18,"level-up",73],[20,"level-up",65]]},{"name":"flamethrower","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"absorb","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-drain","learns":[[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13],[20,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"leech-seed","learns":[[17,"level-up",19],[18,"level-up",19],[20,"level-up",55]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"harden","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"self-destruct","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-blast","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"skull-bash","learns":[[17,"level-up",53],[18,"level-up",53],[20,"level-up",70]]},{"name":"explosion","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rock-slide","learns":[[17,"machine",0